      "sourceTextSha256": "2bdaf67eb9f143e4e35b012b10a1aa4dfdad8599983b61871f9298de946648a2",
      "text": "Breakfast and a day at one of the New Seven Wonders of the World. After the train ride along the Urubamba Valley, our staff help you board the bus that climbs the winding road to Machu Picchu, with spectacular views of the Urubamba River and its canyon. The lost city of the Incas welcomes you with its terraces, ceremonial shrines, stairways and urban areas. After the guided visit, buffet lunch at a restaurant in Aguas Calientes; at the scheduled time, return to Cusco.",
